# Valkyrie's Call returns "that card" (CR 603.10a, 400.7): the card as it is in the graveyard when the trigger goes on the stack.
# Bot1 Bolts its own Memnite, the Call triggers, and in response Bot2 casts Cling to Dust on the Memnite in Bot1's graveyard, exiling
# it (and gaining 3 life, as it was a creature card). The Memnite has become another object in exile, so when the trigger resolves
# there is nothing in the graveyard to return (CR 608.2b) and the battlefield has no Memnite. The scenarios where nobody
# responds are the positive control.

